# Draws the interface art of the headset app the way a web page is drawn - HTML, CSS and hand-written SVG icons - and
# cuts the picture into the textures Unity uses (MetaVRHack/Assets/LivingPartner/Art/Ui). Nothing is generated by a
# model: the page below is the design, a headless Chrome / Edge renders it with a transparent background, and Pillow
# slices it.
#
# The look is the partner's own: a storybook. Round sticker badges - warm paper colours, a dark-brown ink line, a cream
# die-cut edge, a little shine - with the icon and its name drawn in the same ink. (A first version was dark neon glass
# with white app icons: handsome on its own, and nothing to do with a small friend in a yellow raincoat.)
#   python tools/ui-art/build_ui_art.py            -> writes the PNGs and tools/ui-art/sheet.png (the whole sheet)
